[exit 5]

$ jailops explain locked
locked

Cause:  An encrypted volume of the jail waits for its passphrase (after a host boot or a lock); a locked jail does not start.
Fix:    Run 'jailops jail unlock NAME' (add --start to start it at once); a jail due for autostart starts after its unlock.
HTTP:   409
Exit:   5

